Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.
Theorem cross_site_fetch_refused : cross_site (line "Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site") = true.
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.
Theorem same_site_fetch_refused : cross_site (line "Sec-Fetch-Site: same-site") = true.
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.
